source: CostUsageFetcher.loadTokenSnapshot(provider: .codex) with CodexBarCLI.renderCostText, run in-process from each source tree
setup: a real Codex history (~/.codex sessions and archived sessions, read in place; logs_2.sqlite opened read-only) with a copy of the
       real 0.72.0 cost cache (copied 2026-10-05T04:54:27-0300); each run starts from the same copy in a temporary cache root
calendar: America/Santiago; window: 30 days ending 2026-10-05; pricing catalog: the cached models.dev copy, no refresh
redaction: dollar amounts replaced with $•••; dayCost "$" means a cost is present
affected days: an unpriced model has tokens but no catalog price, beside priced models on the same day

